sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff<br/>POS
  participant Payment as Payment<br/>settlement owner
  participant PDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Payment DB
  participant Order as Order<br/>bill/session owner
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>table state owner
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>payment.completed

  Staff->>Payment: Confirm cash payment
  Payment->>PDB: Begin transaction
  Payment->>PDB: Lock payment and verify amount

  alt Amount insufficient or payment not pending
    Payment->>PDB: Roll back transaction
    Payment-->>Staff: Reject payment
  else Payment can be completed
    Payment->>PDB: Save PAID cash<br/>audit + outbox
    PDB-->>Payment: Commit Payment transaction
    Payment->>Order: BILL_MARK_PAID

    alt Bill is already PAID
      Order-->>Payment: Return current bill
    else Bill is PENDING_PAYMENT
      Order->>Order: Mark bill PAID<br/>close active session
      Order->>Catalog: Move table to CLEANING
    end

    Payment-->>Kafka: Publish payment.completed
    Payment-->>Staff: Settlement completed
  end

  Note over Payment,Order: Payment commit is independent from the follow-up Order call<br/>payment.completed keeps a replay-safe finalization path
